<title>USA: Vitafort is awarded $6 mln in damages.</title>
<headline>Vitafort is awarded $6 mln in damages.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitafort International Corp said Monday it had been awarded $5,983,923 in compensatory damages from Keebler Co by an arbitrator of American Arbitration Association for breach of contract.</p>
<p>Keebler had manufactured Vitafort's proprietary fat-free cake product &quot;Caketts&quot; under a co-packing agreement.</p>
<p>Under California law, there is generally no basis for an appeal of this type of arbitration award, Vitafort said.</p>
</text>
